===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|fr|frm|foys}}, from {{inh|fr|fro|foiz}}, {{m|fro|feiz}}, from {{inh|fr|la|vices}}, plural of {{m|la|vicis}}, whence also {{cog|pt|-}} and {{cog|es|vez}}. The devoicing of the onset is obscure, but has been conjectured to derive from the influence of preceding voiceless consonants, especially the ''-s'' in {{m+|fro|deus|t=two}} and {{m|fro|trois|t=three}}.

====Noun====
{{fr-noun|f}}

# [[time]] {{gloss|an instance or repetition of something happening}}
